  "No sources yet. Until you add one, the app plays what you already have — anything in Downloads, and any magnet or torrent file you open yourself.": "Bado hakuna vyanzo. Hadi utakapoongeza kimoja, programu hucheza ulicho nacho tayari — chochote kilicho kwenye Vipakuliwa, na magnet au faili ya torrent yoyote unayoifungua mwenyewe.",
  "No storage settings on this device. Format the drive as FAT32 on a computer — every Android box accepts it.": "Hakuna mipangilio ya hifadhi kwenye kifaa hiki. Fomati diski kama FAT32 kwenye kompyuta — kila kisanduku cha Android hukikubali.",
