  "Nothing on this device can open that file. HEVC/x265 and AV1 depend on the hardware decoder, and older boxes have neither — try a 1080p x264 release.": "Hakuna kitu kwenye kifaa hiki kinachoweza kufungua faili hiyo. HEVC/x265 na AV1 hutegemea kisimbuzi cha maunzi, na visanduku vya zamani havina hata kimoja — jaribu toleo la 1080p x264.",
  "Nothing to play": "Hakuna cha kucheza",
  "Off": "Imezimwa",
  "Off, your own background is left out of it: the theme keeps its own colours while the picture is up, and only moves when a title's artwork covers it.": "Ikiwa imezimwa, mandharinyuma yako mwenyewe huachwa nje: mandhari hubaki na rangi zake wakati picha ipo, na hubadilika tu pale sanaa ya kichwa inapoifunika.",
  "On the air": "Inaonyeshwa sasa",
  "On, the background follows whichever card you're pointing at or have selected. Off, it only changes when you actually open something — steadier on a long list, where sweeping across a row otherwise repaints the whole window card by card.": "Ikiwa imewashwa, mandharinyuma hufuata kadi yoyote unayoielekeza au uliyoichagua. Ikiwa imezimwa, hubadilika tu unapofungua kitu kweli — tulivu zaidi kwenye orodha ndefu, ambapo kupitisha macho kwenye safu kungechora upya dirisha zima kadi kwa kadi.",
  "On, your picture is what the app rests on and the artwork covers it while you're on a film or show. Off, the picture stays put and nothing ever covers it.": "Ikiwa imewashwa, picha yako ndiyo msingi wa programu na sanaa huifunika ukiwa kwenye filamu au kipindi. Ikiwa imezimwa, picha hubaki pale pale na hakuna kinachoifunika kamwe.",
  "One colour, and Material's own generator works out the rest of the palette from it.": "Rangi moja, na jenereta ya Material hukokotoa paleti nzima kutoka kwayo.",
  "One earlier episode in this season is still unwatched.": "Kipindi kimoja cha awali katika msimu huu bado hakijatazamwa.",
  "One earlier season is still unwatched.": "Msimu mmoja wa awali bado haujatazamwa.",
  "One-off or monthly, from any card or PayPal. Ko-fi takes no cut of it.": "Mara moja au kila mwezi, kwa kadi yoyote au kupitia PayPal. Ko-fi haichukui sehemu yoyote.",
  "Only download on Wi-Fi": "Pakua kwa Wi-Fi pekee",
  "Only downloaded subtitles can be synced; the file's own tracks already match it.": "Ni manukuu yaliyopakuliwa tu yanayoweza kulandanishwa; nyimbo za faili yenyewe tayari zinalingana nayo.",
  "Only needed if the app stops loading artwork and titles. Create one free under your TMDB account settings, API, “API Read Access Token”. It is kept out of backup files.": "Inahitajika tu ikiwa programu itaacha kupakia sanaa na vichwa. Tengeneza moja bila malipo katika mipangilio ya akaunti yako ya TMDB, API, “API Read Access Token”. Haiwekwi kwenye faili za nakala rudufu.",
